      "writtenOn": "2011-03-08T01:25:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This substring comparison was intended. Different from file extension, MIME type could have several possibilities. \ne.g.)\n  \"application/vnd.marlin.drm.actiontoken+xml\",\n  \"application/vnd.marlin.drm.conftoken+xml\",\n  \"application/vnd.marlin.drm.license+xml,\n  \"application/vnd.marlin.drm.content,\n  etc.\nAnd it could increase when service introduce more objects for DRM,\nwhereas we cannot add new MIME type to plug-in, afterward.\nTherefore, I did substring comparison, instead of full matching.\n\nIf this treatment is not suitable from the perspective of possible runtime bug,\nI would change the comparison way to use String.equals(), instead.\n\nWhat do you think about it?",
      "parentUuid": "AAAA/H///Ns\u003d",
      "revId": "a08345b92362fc5932242a2608f2a77f3b6c484d",
