      "writtenOn": "2011-03-07T19:08:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why could not we protect the shared resources, the instance vectors in this case, instead of adding a lock for each and every vector that is being used. I am afraid by protecting the instance vectors this way does not make sure consistency across all vectors if there is an coordination between them (does it matter?).",
